1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:02,317
(Penny:)What is that about?

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:06,230
(Leonard:)He's smart and crazy enough.
He may have actually created a monster.

3
00:00:07,026 --> 00:00:08,236
(Sheldon:)Shoo, shoo.

4
00:00:08,402 --> 00:00:09,572
(Sheldon:)Be gone.

5
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:11,027
(Leonard:)What the hell is going on?

6
00:00:11,197 --> 00:00:14,037
(Sheldon:)There's a bird outside the window
and he won't go away.

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,330
(Sheldon:)That is the hell that is going on.

8
00:00:16,994 --> 00:00:20,244
(Sheldon:)We have no worms or seeds here.
Shoo, shoo.

9
00:00:21,499 --> 00:00:24,339
(Penny:)Really? On top of everything else,
you're afraid of birds?

10
00:00:24,502 --> 00:00:28,882
(Sheldon:)It's called ornithophobia, and someday it
will be recognized as a true disability...

11
00:00:29,048 --> 00:00:33,638
(Sheldon:)...and the landlord will be required by
Iaw to put a giant net over the building.

12
00:00:34,178 --> 00:00:37,178
(Sheldon:)Which is unfortunate,
because I have a fear of nets.

13
00:00:37,973 --> 00:00:39,763
(Penny:)So movies, yes or no?

14
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:41,514
- Oh, movies, yes.
Mm.

15
00:00:41,685 --> 00:00:44,855
(Penny:)Great. I'll see you later.
And remember, he's more afraid of you...

16
00:00:45,022 --> 00:00:46,772
(Penny:)- ...than you are of him.
- That doesn't help.

17
00:00:46,941 --> 00:00:48,021
(Leonard:)Oh.

18
00:00:48,192 --> 00:00:50,572
(Penny:)I was talking to the bird.

19
00:00:53,072 --> 00:00:57,242
Go away, bird. Go away, bird.
Go away, bird.

20
00:00:57,409 --> 00:00:59,869
(Leonard:)Sheldon, just ignore him.

21
00:01:00,412 --> 00:01:03,582
(Sheldon:)Good idea.
Attention is what birds want.

22
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,999
(Leonard:)Oh.

23
00:01:06,168 --> 00:01:08,128
(Sheldon:)Much better. All right.

24
00:01:08,295 --> 00:01:10,425
(Sheldon:)Now I'll just get along with my life.

25
00:01:13,592 --> 00:01:18,022
(Sheldon:)Make a pot of tea, Leonard,
it's gonna be a long night.

